# T11 R6 pinned list: static functions of main_psp.c's unit that only main() calls
# and that have no noinline + section() pair.  They exist on the tree this list was
# written from, so where GCC puts them is part of that tree's layout.  A function
# NOT listed here must carry both attributes (ci_greps.py R6).  Regenerate with
# `ci_greps.py --src GPSP --write-r6` on the tree Epoch C starts from, never to
